Thought: To evaluate the model performance, I need to perform two main tasks: evaluate the model using the test set and perform cross-validation. I will start by listing the files in the directory to locate the test data and any other necessary files.
Action: list_files
Action Input: {"path": "/Users/n0w0f/chained_ml_gpt_react_oxide/prepare_ml_ready_dataset_trial_3/oxide_ml_dataset", "recursive": true}

Thought: I have located the test data file (`test.csv`) and the trained model file (`trained_xgboost_model.pkl`). I will now proceed to evaluate the model using the test set.
Action: evaluate_xgboost_model
