Thought: The model evaluation on the test set is complete, and I have obtained the necessary metrics. Next, I will perform cross-validation using the training data to obtain the `r2_mean` and `r2_std`.
Action: perform_cross_validation
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/chained_ml_gpt_react_oxide/prepare_ml_ready_dataset_trial_3/oxide_ml_dataset/train.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "cv_folds": 5}

